From 4c8d8e10f3264822586a64d0971d1ba95b420ca7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Axis Dev <axis-dev@example.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 10:14:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: align Axis pricing page feature copy with actual
 plan entitlements

PLAN_FEATURES on /axis/pricing had drifted from lib/paddle-plans.ts
(the source of truth for what each Axis plan actually grants):

- Pro claimed 'Inventory & custody tracking' and 'Employee management'.
  There is no custody-tracking feature flag. Employee management is
  gated to Advanced only, not Pro.
- Advanced claimed 'Multiple organizations' and 'Dedicated onboarding' -
  neither is a real feature flag in the plan model.
- Starter didn't mention basic_reports, which it does include.

Inventory and employee management are now actually built, so both
plans can correctly advertise the features they're entitled to per
paddle-plans.ts: inventory -> Pro+, employees/custom_email_domain/
connections -> Advanced only.

Also removes 0001-feat-add-axis-pricing-page.patch, a stale leftover
patch file at the repo root whose contents are already merged into
src/app/(public)/axis/pricing/page.tsx.
