-  hand-typed prices to drift out of sync. Fails soft (shows plan/feature
-  info without prices, plus a small notice) if the Paddle call errors,
-  rather than 500ing the page.
-- src/components/Navbar.tsx, Footer.tsx: added Pricing links
-- src/app/sitemap.ts: registered /pricing
-
-Requires a new PADDLE_API_KEY env var in this repo's deployment config
-(not previously used here) — same server-side API key already added to
-axis-business-hub's .env.example for the webhook route; this can reuse
-the same value. This repo has no .env.example file to extend, so this
-is called out here instead.
-
-Also uses a placeholder signup link (https://app.axis.example.com/signup)
-on each plan's CTA button — swap for the real Axis app URL before merging.
-
-Verified: tsc --noEmit and next build both pass clean. Build produces
-/pricing as a dynamic (server-rendered) route rather than static, since
-it reads request headers for IP-based localization — this is expected
-and intentional, not a regression.
